      <title>Exclusive Premiere of We Sweat Kids Edition: Exclusive Premiered by Parade</title>
      <link>https://parade.com/714457/laurawhitmore/exclusive-premiere-watch-the-voice-winner-craig-wayne-boyds-acoustic-video-for-we-sweat/</link>
      <description>“Here’s a really fun, stripped down acoustic video from The Voice season 7 winner, Craig Wayne Boyd for the song, “We Sweat.” This super cute video features Boyd’s kids getting in on the action, and highlight’s Boyd’s powerhouse bluesy vocals. The song appears on his latest release, Top Shelf.Boyd shares, “This video was fun to make and truly reflects life with three kids under 6! I love them dearly and am glad they were a part of it.””Read More Permalink</description>
